ency vehicles, possibly police or fire trucks, trying to navigate through the flooded streets.\n3. **Distant thunder** - The rumbling of thunder, indicating a storm or heavy rain that contributed to the flooding.\n4. **Cars struggling** - The sound of engines struggling or failing as vehicles try to navigate the floodwaters.\n5. **People shouting or screaming** - The chaotic sounds of people trying to escape or call for help, adding to the sense of panic and danger.\n6. **Wind howling** - The sound of strong winds, possibly from the storm, adding to the sense of chaos and urgency.\n7. **Distant sirens or alarms** - The sound of emergency alarms or sirens from distant buildings or emergency services.\n8. **Water splashing** - The sound of water splashing as people or vehicles try to navigate through the floodwaters.\n\nThese sounds would create a sense of urgency, danger, and chaos, highlighting the catastrophic nature of the flooding and the efforts of people and emergency services to respond to the crisis."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 4, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "125b3a4905ac9367f7aae5c2df67e2282f0a3d37", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.3"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "paths", "links": [7], "label": "paths", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "paths"}], "size": [330, 180], "pos": [2664.189697265625, 1109.568359375], "widgets_values": [1, 1], "inputs": [{"name": "path_1", "link": 6, "label": "path_1", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "path_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "inputcount"}, "name": "inputcount", "label": "inputcount", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "inputcount"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "MultiplePathsInput", "properties": {"ver": "70cc35edac